            "sid": "EZK 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi uNkulunkulu ithi: Lapho ngikwenza ube ngumuzi ochithekileyo ongaselabantu, nxa ngiletha ulwandle phezu kwakho lamanzi amanengi akusibekele, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ng’khona ngizakukuphosela phansi kanye lalabo abehlela egodini, ebantwini basendulo, ngikwenze uhlale elizweni elingaphansi, emanxiweni asendulo, kanye lalabo abehlela egodini, ukuze kungahlali muntu kuwe, ungabi landawo elizweni labaphilayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngizakukuchitha ngendlela eyesabekayo, ungabi khona futhi; lanxa udingwa, ungafunyaniswa futhi, kutsho iNkosi uNkulunkulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.21"
            ]
          }
